   "title": "西安交大获第十四届“挑战杯”陕汽集团陕西省大学生课外学术科技作品竞赛最高荣誉",
   "date": "2023-05-25",
   "url": "https://tuanwei.xjtu.edu.cn/passage?id=4504",
   "competition": "",
   "moeNo": null,
   "site": "校团委",
   "sourceLabel": "校团委",
   "dateUnavailableReason": "",
   "isCompetition": true,
